  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "初始引导\nああ、君か。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "随分と久しぶりじゃないか。\nどうやら、君はずっと……境界を彷徨っていたようだな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "自分が何者なのかさえ、覚えていないかもしれないが……名前だけでも思い出せるなら、それで十分だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "――さぁ、ここに長く留まっていてはいけない。\n君は私の客人ではなく、ここにいるべき存在でもないのだから。\n彼女には君が必要なんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "12月23日。\nこの日付が君にとってどんな意味を持っているのか――覚えてはいないかもしれない。\nだが、思い出せないままでは、君は非常に危険な状況に陥りかねないんだ。\n......\nいや、それ以前に――\n君は絶対に、思い出さなければならない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謎の声",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……意識レベルが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謎の声",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "体外循環開始…………心筋保護液の注入、完了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謎の声",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……体温低下……ヘクサメタゾン20ccを静脈に注射。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謎の声",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "止血鉗子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謎の声",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……状態の安定を確認……切除を開始します。……心室細動に注意して……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謎の声",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……ごめんなさい……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謎の声",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "また、苦しめることになってしまって。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ドクター……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……手を……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "私の……を……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "私の手を握って！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "緊急……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……救……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……完了……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ドクター……ドクター！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "医療オペレーターさん、ドクターは大丈夫なんでしょうか……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "今……手を握り返してくれたと思うんです、絶対……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "なのに、まだ意識がはっきりしてないみたいで……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "アーミヤさん！　あまり焦らないで、どうか落ち着いてください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "あっ……ご、ごめんなさい……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "本当に、ドクターのこととなると急に慌ててしまうんですから……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "でも、アーミヤさん。もしもドクターが……目覚めなかったら、どうするつもりなんですか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――心の準備は、できていますから。もしそうなったら……決めていた通りにするだけです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "……わかりました。あなたが言うなら、そうしましょう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "はい……お願いします。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……ドクター……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "安心してください、アーミヤさん。ドクターの容態は安定していますから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "念のため、もう一度検査をしておきましょうか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ありがとうございます……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "うん……確かに、呼吸は弱いですが、血圧は正常値ですね。大きな問題はないと思います。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "目を覚まされましたか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "よかった……！　アーミヤさん、うまくいったみたいですね！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "っ……ドクター……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "よかった……本当に、よかったです……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "あっ、危ない！　無理に動かないでください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "どうか安静に……まだ本調子ではないわけですし。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……どうしたんですか……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "君たちは、誰だ……？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "えっ……？　ドクター、私――"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "私の名前は、アーミヤといいます。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "私たちは……あなたを助けに来たんです。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……「あなた」……というのは……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "はい……目の前にいる、あなたのことですよ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我々と同じ「ロドス」の一員で……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……私の同僚でもある――"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "――Dr.{@nickname}。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "あなたは、私の一番大切な仲間なんです。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……思い出せませんか？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……本当に、信じていいのか？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "……"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "そうですよね。いきなりこんなことを言われても、受け入れがたいだろうと思います。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "私も、すぐにすべてを思い出せるとは思っていませんし、今すぐ信頼してほしいとは言いません。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "もしかして、Dr.{@nickname}は私のことも忘れてしまったんでしょうか……"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "……"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "だとしても……私は諦めません。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "あなたを見つけ出すために、多くの代償を支払ってきましたから……"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "そうか……初めまして、アーミヤ。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "あ……は、初めまして。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "……"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "じゃなくて、ええと……！　すみません、なんと言えばいいのやら……色々なことが、前とは変わってしまいましたし……"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "私自身、変化はありましたから……"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……ですが、とにかく……私にとって、ドクターは一番大切な人なんです。どんなことがあっても、それだけは変わりません。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ですので、少しだけ……私に、時間をもらえませんか。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ほんの少しだけで構いませんから……"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
          "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
          "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
          "text": "ドクターは……本当に、記憶喪失になってしまったんでしょうか？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "今は、これでいいんだと思います。ドクターを負担から遠ざけることもできるかもしれませんし。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "ところで、ここは一体……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "この場所は――"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "えっ？　今のは――"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "完全武装の男",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "アーミヤさん、大変です！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "完全武装の男",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "誰かが施設に侵入してきたみたいで……！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "完全武装の男",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "あの服装……ウルサス兵じゃありませんね！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "――――"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "完全武装の男",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "お前ら、いきなり何のつもりだ！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "完全武装の男",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "撃ってきやがった……！　みなさん、敵襲です！　――あいつら重火力兵器を持ってますよ、アーミヤさん！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
          "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
          "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
          "text": "あわわわ……！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "みなさん、どうかお気をつけて！　遮蔽物を利用しつつ、ドクターを守りましょう！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "しかし、あの服装はまさか……レユニオン？　どうして彼らが……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "――いえ。それよりまずは……前衛オペレーターさん、戦闘の準備をお願いします！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "了解！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "にしても、こいつら……まさか、ドクターを狙ってるのか！？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "いえ……ドクターの存在は、誰にも知られていないはずです。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ひとまず、ケルシー先生に連絡を取ることはできますか？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "それが、なぜか通信しても応答がないんです……！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……どうやら、通信が妨害されているようですね。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ウルサス政府に、我々の位置を気取られたんでしょうか……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "弱ったな……どうしますか？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "本作戦の指揮官はケルシー先生ですが、この状況では指揮を執ることができませんし……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……となれば……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "――Dr.{@nickname}。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "私たちの指揮を、お願いできませんか。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
          "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
          "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
          "text": "き、危険すぎませんか……？　ドクターは意識が戻ったばかりですし……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……試して、みたいんです。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "確かに記憶を失ってはいますが……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……ドクターは、我々と共に戦い続けてきた人ですから。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "たくさんのことを教えてくれて、ありがとうございます……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "私たちは、多くのことを一緒に乗り越えてきたんです。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "だから、わかるんです……ドクターなら、きっと勝利をもたらしてくれるって。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "あなたなら、きっと勝利をもたらしてくれますから。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……急にこんなことをお願いするなんて、無茶な話とは思います。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "でも……どうか、お願いです。私たちを助けてもらえませんか。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "私も、お手伝いしますから！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "それなら、まずはこの連中を片付けよう！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "身を護るには反撃あるのみだ。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……私も、ドクターをまた、こんな争いに巻き込みたくはないのですが……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "今の私たちには、Dr.{@nickname}の知恵が必要なんです。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "戦いの中で、以前の感覚を取り戻すことができたら、というのもありますし……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "――もしかすると、ドクター自身、自分を信じることができないかもしれませんが……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "私は、あなたを信じます。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "――あなたならできると、信じています。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ですから――ロドスの指揮をお願いします、ドクター！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
